+# DayPay — this zip is the newest work, and it is NOT on GitHub yet
+
+You are an AI agent. Inside this zip: the DayPay Employer Version repository exactly as
+built in another Arena session — commit **`47dbf84`**, branch
+`arena/01a0cffa-daypay-employer-version`, **162 files**.
+
+**Why this file exists.** A previous attempt pushed an **empty commit**: PR #2 on
+`akanejr/DayPay-Employer-Version` shows **0 files changed**. That session cloned GitHub
+(which still holds the old, pre-2.0 app, 109 files) and never saw this work. Do not
+repeat that. Use what is in this zip.
+
+## Route A — the exact commit (preferred)
+
+`daypay-47dbf84.bundle` holds the real commit, its message and its history.
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/akanejr/DayPay-Employer-Version.git daypay
+cd daypay
+git fetch ../daypay-47dbf84.bundle 'arena/01a0cffa-daypay-employer-version:arena/01a0cffa-daypay-employer-version'
+git checkout arena/01a0cffa-daypay-employer-version
+git log --oneline -1        # must print 47dbf84
+```
+
+Then **ask the user before pushing**, and push that branch and open a PR to `main`.
+
+## Route B — the files, if the bundle is awkward
+
+Extract the zip over a checkout of `akanejr/DayPay-Employer-Version`, then:
+
+```bash
+git checkout -b arena/01a0cffa-daypay-employer-version
+rm -f PUSH-INSTRUCTIONS.md daypay-47dbf84.bundle    # neither is part of the product
+git add -A && git commit -m "DayPay 2.0 + §41 navigation fix"
+```
+
+Then ask before pushing, and open the PR to `main`.
+
+## How to know it worked
+
+- `git diff --stat origin/main..HEAD` → roughly **96 files changed, +17,750 / −2,826**
+- `docs/NAVIGATION-BACK.md` and `src/lib/router.js` present on the branch
+- In the pull request, **Files changed must not say 0**
+- The pushed branch must not equal `main`
+
+## Rules for the user's workflow
+
+- **Ask before pushing** ("Push to GitHub?") — standing instruction. Never surprise-push.
+- Never ask the user for a GitHub token, PAT, password or 2FA code, and never accept one
+  if offered: the Arena GitHub connection is the credential. A pasted token must be
+  revoked, not used.
+- There is no GitHub connector in Arena — do not try to look for one.
+
+## What this work is
+
+DayPay 2.0 (design system, four destinations, Today / Attendance / People / More, worker
+profile, kiosk, waiting/empty/failed states, desktop layout, consistency, polish) plus
+the **§41 navigation fix**: history entries carry a depth so Android's Back steps up
+instead of closing the app; Settings categories are addresses
+(`/more/settings/<category>`); one shared, visible Back control replaces the grey 12px
+text link.
+
+Verified in the session that produced this zip: unit **532/0** · UI harness **626/626** ·
+`npm run prove` **859 checks / 0 failures** · `npm run build` exit 0.
+Detail: `docs/NAVIGATION-BACK.md` and the §41 section of `docs/PROGRESS.md`.
